{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2835176,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Kuba Michalczuk","original_name":"Kuba Michalczuk","popularity":0.3465,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/bcJqHkchLeU3OvkQ0ZmP4nUisy6.jpg","id":842050,"title":"The In-Laws","original_title":"Teściowie","overview":"Is a party after a canceled wedding a recipe for disaster? It is. And what a disaster it is! Two families differ in everything - origin, status, wallet content, taste. The parents of the groom and bride are initially shocked. What did such a thing happen? Who was at fault? What about the wedding party? Should they welcome the guests? Play music? Pour the vodka? Who will cut the cake? From word to word, polite smiles turn into public washing of dirt. And finally a real bomb goes off... And in the meantime, the wedding party turns into a wild party. And no one is bothered by the absence of the newlyweds.","poster_path":"/kl4rfmSqtGshvV99S6K1TKWxHLH.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[35],"popularity":1.2074,"release_date":"2021-09-10","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.471,"vote_count":70},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/usxXwVbcuUhRZBcYcrOAzeHbfzN.jpg","id":1027649,"title":"You Should Not Exist","original_title":"Miało Cię nie być","overview":"Seventeen-year-old Marianna tries to meet the challenge of finding her place in the world of her father, with whom she has had no contact for a long time. The two work to get to know each other again and rebuild their neglected relationship.","poster_path":"/8ZqYlD8t6AK8qWAi1OPNE084UIh.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[18,35],"popularity":1.4351,"release_date":"2023-10-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":5},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/365MJNDbx4ewOUNDQAe2Vd9FfSs.jpg","id":758678,"title":"Tomorrow","original_title":"Tomorrow","overview":"When more than one million species of plants